### =====================================================================
### Micro-Volunteer Match  —  REST Client test file
### Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (Ctrl+Alt+R on a block)
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl          = http://localhost:9000
@userId           = 6aa25a6e112d027d35b94972
@volunteerId      = REPLACE_WITH_VOLUNTEER_ID
@volunteerProfileId = REPLACE_WITH_VOLUNTEER_PROFILE_ID
@taskId           = REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID
@notificationId   = REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_ID
@ratedUserId      = REPLACE_WITH_RATED_USER_ID


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# USERS  —  /api/users
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register an organizer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Organizer",
  "email": "24eg110a24@anurag.edu.in",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "organizer",
  "interest": ["education", "environment"],
  "skills": ["teaching", "research"]
}

###

### Register a volunteer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jamie Volunteer",
  "email": "jamie@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "volunteer",
  "interest": ["education"],
  "skills": ["organizing"]
}

###

### Login as organizer  (cookie: authToken is set automatically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "24eg110a24@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login as volunteer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jamie@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get user profile  (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile/{{userId}}

###

### Update own profile  (requires auth cookie)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/update/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Updated",
  "interest": ["education", "community"],
  "skills": ["teaching", "organizing"]
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH  —  /api/auth
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Start Google OAuth  (open this URL in a browser — not REST Client)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/google

###

### Get current logged-in user  (requires auth cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

###

### Logout  (clears authToken cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TASKS  —  /api/tasks
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create a task  (organizer or admin only — requires auth cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Help at the community library",
  "description": "Organize donated books for two hours.",
  "category": ["education", "organizing"],
  "members": 1
}

###

### Get all open tasks  (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/all

###

### Get open tasks filtered by category  (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/all?category=education

###

### Get skill-matched tasks for a user  (requires auth cookie, own userId only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/matched/{{userId}}

###

### Accept a task  (volunteer or admin — requires auth cookie)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/accept/{{taskId}}

###

### Complete an accepted task  (volunteer/organizer/admin — requires auth cookie)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/complete/{{taskId}}

###

### Get tasks posted or accepted by a user  (requires auth cookie, own userId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/mine/{{userId}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VOLUNTEER PROFILES  —  /api/volunteers
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get all volunteer profiles  (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers/

###

### Create own volunteer profile  (requires auth cookie; userinfo must be your own id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userinfo": "{{userId}}",
  "interest": ["education", "community"],
  "skills": ["organizing", "teaching"]
}

###

### Get a single volunteer profile by profile id  (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers/{{volunteerProfileId}}

###

### Update own volunteer profile  (requires auth cookie)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers/{{volunteerProfileId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "interest": ["environment", "health"],
  "skills": ["data entry", "communication"]
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RATINGS & BADGES  —  /api/recognition
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Rate a user after completing a task  (requires auth cookie; cannot rate yourself)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recognition/rate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ratedUser": "{{ratedUserId}}",
  "task": "{{taskId}}",
  "rating": 5
}

###

### Get a user's ratings and badges  (requires auth cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recognition/user/{{userId}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTIFICATIONS  —  /api/notifications
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create a notification  (organizer or admin only — requires auth cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": "{{userId}}",
  "taskinfo": "{{taskId}}",
  "category": "regular",
  "message": "Your task has been accepted."
}

###

### Get own notifications  (requires auth cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/user/{{userId}}

###

### Mark a notification as read  (requires auth cookie, must be owner)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read/{{notificationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Delete a notification  (requires auth cookie, must be owner or admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}
